WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.899
Hi, I'm Sara from A9 Voice.

2
00:00:02.939 --> 00:00:06.293
A9 Voice doesn't lock you
into one speech engine.

3
00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:07.748
Here's how to choose.

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.392
A cloud service works as
soon as you add your own key.

5
00:00:12.432 --> 00:00:15.265
Your audio goes only to
the services you choose.

6
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.750
Or download a model that runs on your PC,

7
00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:21.960
and then nothing you say leaves it.

8
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.866
A graphics card makes
the bigger models quick.

9
00:00:24.906 --> 00:00:28.466
Without one, A9 Voice recommends
Parakeet V2 for English.

10
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.611
Under What each job uses,
choose who does dictation,

11
00:00:32.651 --> 00:00:34.362
who does your meeting notes,

12
00:00:34.402 --> 00:00:37.238
and a fallback for
dictation in case it fails.

13
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:39.730
That's it.

14
00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:41.193
Pick what fits you.
